<div class="guide-styles" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">Welcome to Wowhead's Best in Slot Gear list for Blood Death Knight Tanking in Cataclysm Classic Pre-Raid. Gear in this guide is primarily obtained from Heroic Dungeons, Reputations, and BoE Craftables. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from dungeons, professions, Bind on Equip drops, and reputations.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">
<span class="c6">Best in Slot Gear for Blood Death Knight Pre-Raid</span></h2>
<ol>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Mastery</b> - Mastery provides <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=77513/blood-shield">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_deathknight_deathstrike.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Blood Shield</span></a> for self-sustain tanking and smoother damage taken profiles. This Secondary Stat will be your primary focus when seeking out gear for each slot.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Stamina</b> - Stamina is the cornerstone stat for all tanks. Stamina provides <span class="r3">EHP</span> and a higher <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=93099/vengeance">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_paladin_shieldofvengeance.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vengeance</span></a> ceiling.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Strength</b> - Strength provides Attack Power and gives us more damage on all abilities. All of our gear choices, except for trinkets, will have Strength because Agility no longer provides Armor or Dodge Rating.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Avoidance Ratings</b> - Avoidance Ratings are subjected to significantly higher Diminishing Returns now than in WotLK Classic. In Cataclysm, you'll find yourself reforging Dodge or Parry Rating to Mastery when the item doesn't already have Mastery.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Hit Rating</b> - Hit Rating is a crucial Secondary Stat for ensuring our opener and rotation are as smooth as possible. <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=77575/outbreak">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_deathvortex.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Outbreak</span></a> and <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=56815/rune-strike">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_deathknight_darkconviction.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rune Strike</span></a> can both miss and cause our <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=49998/death-strike">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_deathknight_butcher2.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Death Strike</span></a> to break down and leave us vulnerable.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Expertise Rating</b> - Expertise Rating is one of our strongest secondary stats for increasing our damage and the consistency with which we land our Weapon Strikes.</div></li></ol>
