<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="shoulders-for-blood-death-knight-tanking">Shoulders for Blood Death Knight Tanking</h4>The best Shoulder slot item Pre-Raid will be <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67144/pauldrons-of-edward-the-odd">
<img alt="Pauldrons of Edward the Odd" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_plate_raidpaladin_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pauldrons of Edward the Odd</span></a>. Due to the unknown factor of how available this BoE will be, <b>
<i>do not count on being able to obtain these.</i></b>
<br/>
<br/>The next best are listed below.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Shoulder Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62333/greater-inscription-of-unbreakable-quartz">
<img alt="Greater Inscription of Unbreakable Quartz" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_crystal_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greater Inscription of Unbreakable Quartz</span></a> from Exalted reputation with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1171/therazane">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Therazane</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
