<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="cloak-for-blood-death-knight-tanking">Cloak for Blood Death Knight Tanking</h4>The best option for cloaks is the Exalted with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1158/guardians-of-hyjal">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Guardians of Hyjal</span></a> choice <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62383/wrap-of-the-great-turtle">
<img alt="Wrap of the Great Turtle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_tank_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wrap of the Great Turtle</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Cloak Enchant</b>: As far as the traditional enchants go, <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52777/enchant-cloak-greater-critical-strike">
<img alt="Enchant Cloak - Greater Critical Strike" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enchantedscroll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Cloak - Greater Critical Strike</span></a> has the highest stat budget of any of the cloak enchants for <span class="c6">
<span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_deathknight.gif");'>Blood Death Knights</span></span>.<br/>
<br/>If you're looking for more mitigation, any of the various resistance enchants are great options for progression on specific bosses. Ex: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=44590/enchant-cloak-superior-shadow-resistance">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Cloak - Superior Shadow Resistance</span></a>. With <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=202/engineering">
<img alt="Engineering" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Engineering</span></a> tinkers stacking with traditional enchants, you'll want to place <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=41111/flexweave-underlay">
<img alt="Flexweave Underlay" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_22.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Flexweave Underlay</span></a> if you're an Engineer.<div class="pad"></div>
