<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="chest-for-blood-death-knight-tanking">Chest for Blood Death Knight Tanking</h4>The best overall choice for the Chest slot is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=55058/hardened-elementium-hauberk">
<img alt="Hardened Elementium Hauberk" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_raidwarrior_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hardened Elementium Hauberk</span></a>. If you're short on cash or don't have a guild friend to craft for you, the next best option is <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=63458/lord-waldens-breastplate">
<img alt="Lord Walden's Breastplate" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_dungeonplate_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lord Walden's Breastplate</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Chest Enchant</b>: <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52780/enchant-chest-greater-stamina">
<img alt="Enchant Chest - Greater Stamina" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enchantedscroll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Chest - Greater Stamina</span></a> is the best option for <span class="c6">
<span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_deathknight.gif");'>Blood Death Knights</span></span>.<div class="pad"></div>
