<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="bracer-for-blood-death-knight-tanking">Bracer for Blood Death Knight Tanking</h4>The Bracer slot for Pre-Raid is a bit annoying because the 2 viable options sit above the others due to Mastery and Hit Rating <b>
<i>plus</i></b> a socket with a Mastery socket bonus. It isn't even close. The best being <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=57870/alpha-bracers">
<img alt="Alpha Bracers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_plate_dungeonplate_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Alpha Bracers</span></a> or if you have the gold, <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67238/terboruss-rotating-bands">
<img alt="Terborus's Rotating Bands" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_plate_dungeonplate_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Terborus's Rotating Bands</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Bracer Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=62256/enchant-bracer-major-stamina">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Bracer - Major Stamina</span></a> is our best enchant in Cataclysm Classic, unless you're <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=165/leatherworking">
<img alt="Leatherworking" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_armorkit_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leatherworking</span></a> and can use <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=85007/draconic-embossment-stamina">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_leatherworking.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Draconic Embossment - Stamina</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
