<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="gloves-for-blood-death-knight-tanking">Gloves for Blood Death Knight Tanking</h4>The Glove armor slot sees a negligible difference between the two primary choices. <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56428/fingers-of-light">
<img alt="Fingers of Light" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_plate_dungeonplate_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fingers of Light</span></a> which utilizes a <span class="gem2">Red Socket</span> with a <b>Mastery</b> socket bonus, will be our best option.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Glove Enchant</b>: You'll have two options for the glove enchant depending on an <span class="r3">EHP</span> focus or <b>Mastery</b> focus: <a class="q2 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56517/heavy-savage-armor-kit">
<img alt="Heavy Savage Armor Kit" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_armorkit_30.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heavy Savage Armor Kit</span></a> or <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52784/enchant-gloves-greater-mastery">
<img alt="Enchant Gloves - Greater Mastery" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enchantedscroll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Gloves - Greater Mastery</span></a>. For <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=202/engineering">
<img alt="Engineering" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Engineering</span></a> tinkers, the choice is between damage and mitigation with <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=82175/synapse-springs">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Synapse Springs</span></a> and <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=82177/quickflip-deflection-plates">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Quickflip Deflection Plates</span></a> respectively.<div class="pad"></div>
