<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="belt-for-blood-death-knight-tanking">Belt for Blood Death Knight Tanking</h4>Best Belt option Pre-Raid is crafted BoE <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=55059/hardened-elementium-girdle">
<img alt="Hardened Elementium Girdle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_plate_raidwarrior_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hardened Elementium Girdle</span></a> from <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=164/blacksmithing">
<img alt="Blacksmithing" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_blacksmithing.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Blacksmithing</span></a>. If you're short on gold or can't get a guild member to help craft, the next best is a heroic dungeon drop <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56392/sand-dune-belt">
<img alt="Sand Dune Belt" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_plate_dungeonplate_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sand Dune Belt</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>Don't forget to use <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=55054/ebonsteel-belt-buckle">
<img alt="Ebonsteel Belt Buckle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_83.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ebonsteel Belt Buckle</span></a> to open up another <b>Gem Slot</b>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Belt Tinker</b>: For Engineers, you'll be able to add new tinkers to your belt slot. The most obivous choice is <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=41118/nitro-boosts">
<img alt="Nitro Boosts" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gizmo_rocketbootextreme.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nitro Boosts</span></a>. Despite the newly introduced <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=94794/rocket-fuel-leak">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_flameblades.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rocket Fuel Leak</span></a>, the utility this tinker provides will be strong for Blood Death Knights.<div class="pad"></div>
