<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="legs-for-blood-death-knight-tanking">Legs for Blood Death Knight Tanking</h4>The best Pre-Raid Legplates are the <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60342/magma-plated-legplates">
<img alt="Magma Plated Legplates" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_raiddeathknight_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Magma Plated Legplates</span></a>. Make sure to get your Valor Point caps before the first raid launch!<br/>
<br/>Alternative options are listed below.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Leg Armor:</b> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71720/drakehide-leg-armor">
<img alt="Drakehide Leg Armor" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cataclysmarmorkit_08.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Drakehide Leg Armor</span></a> is the strongest leg enchant.<div class="pad"></div>
<table class="grid max-width">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td data-background="c6" style="width: 10%; max-width: 100%;">
