<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="trinkets-for-blood-death-knight-tanking">Trinkets for Blood Death Knight Tanking</h4>Trinkets in Phase 1 Pre-Raid are few and far-between. Your choices will be <b>
<i>largely</i></b> dictated by your profession choice. <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_alchemy.gif");'>
<b>Alchemists</b></span> and <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_01.gif");'>
<b>Jewelcrafters</b></span> will have it easier since they're able to craft a trinket before they reach level 85 and use it during the leveling process and going into Heroic Dungeons and Raids.<br/>
<br/>
<b>
<ins>
<span class="q5">Special Note:</span></ins></b> <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_alliance.gif");'>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62471/mirror-of-broken-images">
<img alt="Mirror of Broken Images" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_platnumdisks.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mirror of Broken Images</span></a></span> /<wbr/> <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_horde.gif");'>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62466/mirror-of-broken-images">
<img alt="Mirror of Broken Images" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_platnumdisks.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mirror of Broken Images</span></a></span> will likely see use <i>throughout</i> Cataclysm. Don't be hasty to ditch this trinket as the "On-Use" effect is very powerful for increasing your survivability for magic damage nukes. This is similar to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=50364/sindragosas-flawless-fang">
<img alt="Sindragosa's Flawless Fang" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_trinket_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sindragosa's Flawless Fang</span></a> and how it saw use for <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=36853/sindragosa">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sindragosa</span></a>'s <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=69649/frost-breath">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_frost_frostnova.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Frost Breath</span></a>and <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=36597/the-lich-king">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The Lich King</span></a>'s <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=69409/soul-reaper">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_rogue_shadowdance.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Soul Reaper</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
