<hr/>
<br/>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="weapons">Weapons for Blood Death Knight Tanking</h3>In Cataclysm Classic, it is no longer viable to Dual Wield as Blood Death Knights. All of our options going forward will be a 2 Handed Weapon of some kind with the higher item level items <i>usually</i> having an advantage over lower item level items. Along with that change, a reminder that Agility no longer provides additional Dodge Rating or Armor, so in most cases, Polearms like <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56382/selizas-spear">
<img alt="Seliza's Spear" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_polearm_2h_cataclysm_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Seliza's Spear</span></a> will be banked and used solely for Transmogrification.<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="2-handed-weapons-for-blood-death-knight-tanking">2-Handed Weapons for Blood Death Knight Tanking</h4>If you farmed <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=794/archaeology">
<img alt="Archaeology" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Archaeology</span></a> in Pre-Patch, then hopefully you were lucky enough to see <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64377/zinrokh-destroyer-of-worlds">
<img alt="Zin'rokh, Destroyer of Worlds" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology_zinrokh-sword.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Zin'rokh, Destroyer of Worlds</span></a> as that is our Pre-Raid BiS.<br/>
<br/>If not, don't fret. <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56342/sword-of-the-bottomless-pit">
<img alt="Sword of the Bottomless Pit" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_2h_cataclysm_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sword of the Bottomless Pit</span></a> is a close second and offers mastery as a base secondary stat.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Runeforge</b>: For Mitigation you'll use <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=62158/rune-of-the-stoneskin-gargoyle">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_130.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rune of the Stoneskin Gargoyle</span></a> and for Damage you'll use <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=53344/rune-of-the-fallen-crusader">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_retributionaura.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rune of the Fallen Crusader</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
