<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="relics-for-blood-death-knight-tanking">Relics for Blood Death Knight Tanking</h4>The Relic slot changes quite drastically as it is no longer a unique effect for each relic. Instead, you'll find Primary and Secondary Stats + a Prismatic Socket that can hold any standard gem color but there are no socket bonuses. Typically, the higher item level relic will be your go-to.<div class="pad"></div>
